/-!
*Theorem XIV.* _The divisor group of $`F_K(\mathbf Q)` is $`D_K(\mathbf Q)`, degrees corresponding
to $`\deg_q`; every semi-periodic divisor is an $`N_{\mathbf Q}`-norm of a $`q`-periodic divisor._
-/

